# Next.js

Before adding or changing the frontend, read `docs/nextjs.md`. For any Next.js API it does not cover, open the matching page on https://nextjs.org/docs and follow that page.

The chat UI posts `{ "message": string }` to the FastAPI route `/api/chat` and renders `{ "reply": string }`. Keep `OPENAI_API_KEY` on the Python server.
